  "This file is from an older version of Duitful, which didn't save which spends went on a credit card, so they count as cash here. If you charged spends to a card, update Duitful where you made this file, export again and import the new file.": "这个文件来自旧版 Duitful，旧版没有记下哪些消费是刷信用卡的，所以这里都算作现金。如果你有消费记在卡上，请先更新生成这个文件的 Duitful，重新导出，再导入新文件。",
  "In the app, tap Restore from backup → CSV (or Settings → Import CSV) and pick the file you saved (Files → Downloads).": "在应用里点“从备份恢复”→ CSV（或“设置”→“导入 CSV”），选你刚保存的文件（文件 → 下载）。",
  "On a Mac? AirDrop the file to your iPhone first.": "用的是 Mac？先用隔空投送把文件传到 iPhone。",
  "Delete the CSV file afterwards. It isn't encrypted.": "完成后删除这个 CSV 文件，它没有加密。",
  "I've already moved my data": "我已经迁移了数据",
  "You're already using Duitful as an installed app — nice.": "你已经在用安装版的 Duitful 了——很好。",
  "Everything works offline from here on. Tap Next to continue the tour.": "接下来一切都能离线使用。点“下一步”继续导览。",
  "Install Duitful on your home screen — it opens fullscreen, runs offline, and feels like a native app.": "把 Duitful 安装到主屏幕——全屏打开、支持离线，用起来就像原生应用。",
  "Tap the <strong>Share</strong> button {icon} at the bottom of Safari.": "点击 Safari 底部的<strong>分享</strong>按钮 {icon}。",
  "Scroll down and tap <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>.": "向下滚动并点击<strong>添加到主屏幕</strong>。",
  "Tap <strong>Add</strong> in the top-right.": "点击右上角的<strong>添加</strong>。",
  "The Duitful wallet icon will appear on your home screen. Tap it to open.": "Duitful 钱包图标会出现在主屏幕上，点它即可打开。",
  "iPhone installs need Safari. Open Duitful in Safari first, then follow the steps below.": "iPhone 安装需要用 Safari。先在 Safari 打开 Duitful，再按以下步骤操作。",
  "Copy this URL: <strong>duitful.app</strong>": "复制这个网址：<strong>duitful.app</strong>",
  "Open <strong>Safari</strong> and paste the URL.": "打开 <strong>Safari</strong> 并粘贴网址。",
  "Tap the <strong>Share</strong> button {icon} → <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong> → <strong>Add</strong>.": "点击<strong>分享</strong>按钮 {icon} → <strong>添加到主屏幕</strong> → <strong>添加</strong>。",
  "iOS only lets Safari install web apps — other browsers can't.": "iOS 只允许 Safari 安装网页应用——其他浏览器不行。",
